flowchart TB
    accTitle: Implemented Robotics Case Architecture
    accDescr: Three static cases call owned model execution paths through the Pi05 evaluator bridge or Cosmos engine. Optional adapters use independent robotics kernels. Framework and simulator dependencies remain external. Dynamic cases remain planned.
    pi05["pi05_libero CLI"] --> evaluator["External evaluator bridge"]
    cosmos["cosmos_libero / cosmos_robocasa CLI"] --> runner["Static runner"]
    runner --> engine["Cosmos engine"]
    runner --> simulator["LIBERO / RoboCasa adapters"]
    engine --> models["Owned PI0.5 / Cosmos execution"]
    evaluator --> models
    models --> optimizations["Optional fusion / precision adapters"]
    optimizations --> kernels["Independent robotics kernels"]
    models --> external["External framework and simulator dependencies"]
    simulator --> external
    evaluator --> external
    evaluator --> artifacts["Episode records / audits / videos"]
    runner --> artifacts
    artifacts --> tools["CPU summaries / trajectory metrics / speedup tools"]
    contracts["Schemas and protocol definitions"] -.-> artifacts
    dynamic["Planned: DynamicVLA + DOM / native JAX Kinetix"] -.-> contracts
    classDef existing fill:#dcfce7,stroke:#15803d,color:#14532d
    classDef planned fill:#dbeafe,stroke:#2563eb,color:#172554
    classDef external fill:#f1f5f9,stroke:#64748b,color:#0f172a
